extraction_notes: "THE FEMALE-ONLY REQUIREMENT IS IN `restrictions`, NOT `attribute_requirements`. The book prints ''Must be female'' inside its Attribute Requirements line, and that block is a flat map of the eight attributes checked as minimums - there is no sex or gender on a character to check against. THE CONDITIONAL BONUSES ARE NOT IN `bonuses`: the O.C.C. Bonus line ends ''All bonuses, other than H.F., apply only when piloting a Glitter Boy'', so the +1 strike, +1 roll, +5 pull punch, the +1 initiative at levels 2/4/8/12 and the +1 attack at levels 4/10 are all special_abilities. The +1 M.E. and +2 P.P. ARE stored - the book prints them as attribute gains rather than piloting bonuses, and an attribute the pilot only has while in the armor is not a thing the sheet can hold. The +10 S.D.C. is stored unconditionally for the same reason it is on the Descended Glitter Boy Pilot: an S.D.C. bonus that applies only inside a Mega-Damage power armor is inert by construction. Surveillance carries only its unconditional +5%; the +10% to tailing when out of the armor is a special ability. Money: monthly salary 3,200 credits, one month''s pay to start. See BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT.md F32 for the neighbouring problem of a requirement the block cannot state."
