## Lore

Glitter Girls, or Gigis, are fundamentally Glitter Boy pilots with training in
intelligence gathering and espionage. They are extremely alert, observant and
resourceful, and all are female.

The Glitter Girl armor is the pilot''s own ' || char(8212) || ' a lighter, faster suit built around
the QST-104 assault cannon rather than the Boom Gun ' || char(8212) || ' though a different type of
Glitter Boy may be assigned as the situation demands or supply allows.

## GM Notes

Average level of experience for an NPC is 1D4+6.

Average rank: starts as a 2nd Lieutenant, with experienced officers averaging
Colonel.

Rarely assigned a Side Kick or a Reload Team unless involved in mass combat and
sieges ' || char(8212) || ' the Glitter Girl''s armor is not one of the two that depend on a Reload
Team, which are the Classic and the Taurus.

The soldier''s quarters is a small apartment, typically in the same building as
her teammates: living room, bathroom with tub and shower, study, kitchenette and
bedroom, with a CD stereo, television and VCD, mini-refrigerator, basic
furniture and a comfortable bed.
', 'published', 'data-script'
